  "job_B3.4.6_20251003_114748": {
    "text": "Alia omelia de die iudicii..\nMen \u00fea leofestan, s\u00e6g\u00f0 us on \u00feyssum bocum hu se halga Thomas, Godes apostol, acsode urne dryhten\n\u00d0a w\u00e6s dryhten sprecende to him & \u00f0us cw\u00e6\u00f0: Hit gedafena\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hit sie on \u00f0am nexstan tide.\n\u00deonne hungor & sweorda gefeoht bi\u00f0, & mycel \u00fereatnes geworden bi\u00f0, & manigra folca gefehta beo\u00f0 in\n& \u00fe\u00e6t eac \u00fe\u00e6t minra m\u00e6ssepreosta cweme\u00f0 \u00e6lc o\u00f0rum on his spr\u00e6ce & hie \u00feonne nabba\u00f0 sybbe him\n& \u00feonne gesyh\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t folc \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea m\u00e6ssepreostas bio\u00f0 mid unriht gefyllede ymbe hiora welan, & hie\n& manige men bio\u00f0 \u00feonne \u00feurh \u00fea \u00feincg geni\u00f0rade.\n& goldhord bio\u00f0 \u00feonne geopenode geond eall eor\u00f0an ymbhwyrft, & Godes \u00e6we beo\u00f0 gefylde, & mycel\n& \u00fea halignessa beo\u00f0 \u00feonne formolsnode, & \u00fea m\u00e6ssepreostas beo\u00f0 \u00feonne on unriht awende fram\n& \u00feonne bi\u00f0 eac on \u00f0am dagum yfeles nihtsumnesse, & \u00e6fensangas bio\u00f0 \u00feonne gewitene & oftogene of\n& \u00feonne arisa\u00f0 twegen ealdormen to \u00feeoda werigum on heora dagum.\n\u00deonne bi\u00f0 hungeres genihtsumnesse.\n\u00d0onne arise\u00f0 \u00feeod wi\u00f0 \u00feeode, & hie bio\u00f0 \u00feonne aytte fram heora gem\u00e6rum.\n& \u00feonne arise\u00f0 sum swi\u00f0e weor\u00f0 cyning, & se bebeode\u00f0 \u00feam manncynne \u00fe\u00e6t man wyrce gyldene\nBi\u00f0 \u00feonne on \u00fea tid martyra genihtsumnesse, for \u00f0am \u00feingum \u00fe\u00e6t man cwelme\u00f0 \u00fea m\u00e6ran \u00fee nella\u00f0\n& \u00e6fter \u00f0yssum geweor\u00f0e\u00f0 manna geleafa to Gode gehwyrfed, & hie beo\u00f0 on his halignessa gebledsod,\n& \u00feonne \u00e6fter fean tidum arise\u00f0 sum swi\u00f0e m\u00e6re cyning fram eastd\u00e6le, & hw\u00e6\u00f0re se bi\u00f0 lufigende\n& \u00feonne \u00e6fter him arise\u00f0 eft sum o\u00f0er cyning fram su\u00f0d\u00e6le, & se hafa\u00f0 swi\u00f0e mycel on his\n& goldhord bio\u00f0 asprungenne wi\u00f0 Romanisce \u00feeode.\n& \u00feonne bebeode\u00f0 se ilca cyning \u00fe\u00e6t his mycla gestreon man tod\u00e6le wi\u00f0 hw\u00e6tes genihtsumnesse &\n& swa \u00f0eahhw\u00e6\u00f0ere \u00f0\u00e6r bi\u00f0 ceapes genihtsumnesse, & heora goldes ontimbernesse & hiora seolfor bi\u00f0\nFor \u00f0an on s\u00e6 bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t scipli\u00f0endra cwalm swa mycel \u00fe\u00e6t n\u00e6nig man ne wat to secganne ne n\u00e6nigum\n\u00c6fter \u00fean arise\u00f0 o\u00f0er cynning swi\u00f0e \u00feweorh, & se hafa\u00f0 geweald ofer middangeard, & fea tide he bi\u00f0\n& \u00feonne \u00e6fter \u00fean arise\u00f0 fram eastd\u00e6le, on \u00f0am mycelan Babilonia ceastre, swi\u00f0e mycel hungor &\n& \u00feonne \u00e6fter \u00fean bio\u00f0 ealle w\u00e6teras & ealle wyllas on blode, & steorran fealla\u00f0 of heofenum on\n\u00d0is sindon \u00fea foretacnu to \u00feam dagum \u00fee hit neal\u00e6ce\u00f0 to Antecristes cyme.\nWa \u00f0am mannum \u00fee in \u00f0am dagum eardia\u00f0 ofer eor\u00f0an for \u00f0am brogum \u00fee \u00feonne cuma\u00f0 & cuman\nWa \u00f0am mannum \u00fee \u00feonne hus timbria\u00f0 & bearn gestryna\u00f0!\nWa \u00f0am mannum \u00fee \u00feonne wifia\u00f0 & eor\u00f0licum spedum tilia\u00f0 & stryna\u00f0, for \u00fean hie ealinga on wog\nWa \u00f0am mannum \u00feonne \u00fee ge\u00feeode\u00f0 hus to huse & land to lande, for \u00fean hit eall mid fyre forb\u00e6rne\u00f0\nWa \u00f0am mannum \u00feonne \u00fee hie sylfe ne woldon \u00e6r behealdan for heora synna \u00fee hie \u00e6r worhton & hie\n\u00deis is \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6lmihtigan dryhtnes sylfes mu\u00f0es cwide, & he \u00f0us w\u00e6s cwe\u00f0ende: Ic eom se\n\u00de\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6t is so\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ic secge, \u00fe\u00e6t ealle \u00feas tacenu bio\u00f0 \u00e6t \u00feysse worulde ende ge\u00e6tywde, & eac bi\u00f0\nFor \u00f0an manegum men bi\u00f0 swi\u00f0e mycel nyd\u00feearf \u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6re tide \u00fe\u00e6t hie to Gode gehwyrfen, for \u00fean in\n& \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00feonne \u00fey \u00e6restan d\u00e6ge \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6reste foretacn \u00e6r \u00f0am domesd\u00e6ge.\n\u00de\u00e6t is \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0, \u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6re \u00feriddan tide d\u00e6ges on Monand\u00e6ge, swi\u00f0e mycel geomrung, & \u00fe\u00e6r bi\u00f0 mycel\n& swi\u00f0e mycel blodig wolen astige\u00f0 fram nor\u00f0wear\u00f0um of heofone, & bio\u00f0 \u00feonne swi\u00f0e mycele\n& \u00feam folga\u00f0 sum swi\u00f0e mycel wolcenn, & \u00fe\u00e6t wolcen bewyrg\u00f0 ealne heofon.\n& \u00feanon cyme\u00f0 swi\u00f0e mycel blodig regn of \u00f0am wolcne ofer ealle eor\u00f0an.\n\u00deis syndon \u00fe\u00e6s Monand\u00e6ges foretacnu.\n& \u00feonne bi\u00f0 on Tiwesd\u00e6ge swi\u00f0e mycel stefn gehyred on eastweardum heofones roderum, & swi\u00f0e\n& \u00feonne bi\u00f0 se heofon mid micle wolcne bewrigen fram \u00e6rnemergen o\u00f0 \u00e6fen.\n\u00deis syndon \u00fe\u00e6s Tiwesd\u00e6ges tacnu.\n& \u00feonne \u00fey \u00feriddan d\u00e6ge, \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 on Wodnesd\u00e6g, \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6re \u00e6fteran tide \u00fe\u00e6s d\u00e6ges \u00feonne cyme\u00f0\n& weallas bio\u00f0 cyrmende & eor\u00f0an grundas of feower hwommum \u00feysses middangeardes.\n& se \u00e6resta heofon bi\u00f0 gefealden & tolesen swa swa boca leaf beo\u00f0, & \u00fe\u00e6t he eft ne \u00e6tywe\u00f0.\n& \u00feonne \u00e6fter \u00feam swi\u00f0e ra\u00f0e bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t seo sweoflennesse \u00fe\u00e6t mu\u00f0 geopenade & grundas a\u00feystrode on\n& \u00feonne cwe\u00f0a\u00f0 ealle men: Wa us nu earmingas & swa synfullan \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00e6fre \u00feis sceoldon gebidan.\nWa us \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00e6fre gestrynde w\u00e6ron o\u00f0\u00f0e geborene.\n& nu we magon geseon & witan witodlice \u00f0\u00e6t nu neal\u00e6ce\u00f0 ure ended\u00e6ge, swa us oft s\u00e6gdon \u00f0a \u00f0e\nWa us nu earmingas \u00fe\u00e6t we nu lifia\u00f0 to lange on swylcum ege \u00fe\u00e6s we n\u00e6fre ne wendon, \u00feonne man\nAc we his ne rohton, ac we lufedon micle swi\u00f0or ura wamba fylnesse & on ure gold & on ure\nSwi\u00f0or we \u00fe\u00e6t lufedon \u00feonne we dydon Godes beboda, & \u00feyllic \u00fee we nu geseo\u00f0.\nWa \u00f0am \u00fee \u00f0is eal sceal gebidan.\n\u00d0is syndon \u00fe\u00e6s Wodnesd\u00e6ges tacnu.\n& \u00feonne on \u00deurresd\u00e6ge \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feonne arise\u00f0 eor\u00f0an frym\u00f0e fram nor\u00f0d\u00e6le & fram eastd\u00e6le, &\n& diofulgild bi\u00f0 \u00feonne tobrocen & ealle geni\u00f0timbernesse gefylled on \u00f0am d\u00e6ge.\n\u00d0is sindon \u00fe\u00e6s feor\u00f0an d\u00e6ges tacnu.\n& \u00f0onne on Friged\u00e6ge \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6re syxtan tide \u00feonne brece\u00f0 heofones rodor fram eastd\u00e6le o\u00f0 \u00f0one\n& \u00feonne beo\u00f0 lociende dryhtnes englas ufan on \u00feas eor\u00f0lican gesceafta \u00feurh \u00fea ungewemmedan duru.\n& \u00feonne ealle men \u00e6fter \u00fean sona mid mycle egesan swi\u00f0e ge\u00fereade beo\u00f0, & hie \u00feonne fleo\u00f0 to\n& us eor\u00f0e eac forswelge & swi\u00f0e hra\u00f0e gegripe, \u00fe\u00e6t we n\u00e6fre eft cwice arisan, for \u00f0an \u00fee we n\u00e6fre\nWa \u00f0am \u00fee \u00f0\u00e6t eall sceal gebidan.\n& \u00f0onne is \u00fe\u00e6s S\u00e6ternesd\u00e6ges tacenu \u00fe\u00e6t fram \u00feam feower sceatum middangeardes bi\u00f0 gefylled on\n& \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6r bi\u00f0 micel gefeoht betweoh englas & deofla, & hie gestefnia\u00f0 him betweonum wi\u00f0 \u00f0am\n& \u00feonne \u00f0a englas oferswi\u00f0a\u00f0 \u00f0a werigdan gastas, & hie \u00feonne mid ealle ofercuma\u00f0.\nBro\u00f0or mine, \u00feis sindon \u00fe\u00e6s S\u00e6ternesd\u00e6ges tacno, & \u00fea mihtlican \u00fea \u00fee geweor\u00f0a\u00f0 \u00e6r \u00f0am myclan\n& \u00feonne on Sunnand\u00e6ge, so\u00f0lice in \u00f0am d\u00e6ge ures dryhtnes onsyn bi\u00f0 swi\u00f0e re\u00f0e & swi\u00f0e egesful &\n& \u00feonne gesyh\u00f0 ure leofe hl\u00e6fdie, sancta Maria, Cristes moder, \u00feone earman heap & \u00feone sarigan &\nNe forl\u00e6t \u00f0u n\u00e6fre \u00fea deofla geweald agan \u00f0us myclan heapes \u00feines handgeworces.\n\u00d0onne forgife\u00f0 ure dryhten \u00feryddan d\u00e6l \u00fe\u00e6s synfullan heapes \u00fe\u00e6re halgan sancta Marian.\n\u00deonne bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6r gyt behindan swi\u00f0e mycel heap & swi\u00f0e sarig & dreorig \u00fe\u00e6s \u00f0e hie \u00e6fre gewurdon\n& \u00feonne arise\u00f0 se halga Michael & cryp\u00f0 mid handum & mid fotum & mid mycle wean & fela teara\n& nu ic \u00f0e bidde, min drihten, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u n\u00e6fre forl\u00e6te \u00f0us myclan heapes geweald dioflu agan \u00feines\n& \u00feonne forgife\u00f0 ure dryhten \u00feam halgan sancte Michael \u00feone \u00feriddan d\u00e6l \u00f0\u00e6s synfullan heapes.\n& \u00feonne bi\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6r gyt swi\u00f0e mycel werod & swi\u00f0e oferm\u00e6tlice mycel behindan \u00feara synfullra sawla.\n& \u00feonne arise\u00f0 se halga sanctus Petrus, his ealdor\u00feegn, swi\u00f0e sarig & swi\u00f0e dreorig & mid miclan\nIc bidde \u00fee, min dryhten, for \u00feinum cynedome & for \u00feinum \u00ferymme, \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0u me forgife \u00f0ysses earman\n& \u00feonne forgife\u00f0 ure dryhten \u00f0am halgan sancte Petre \u00f0one \u00f0riddan d\u00e6l \u00fe\u00e6s synfullan heapes.\n& \u00feonne bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6r gyt swi\u00f0e mycel werod behindan, & \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 Gode swi\u00f0e la\u00f0.\n\u00d0onne besyh\u00f0 se so\u00f0f\u00e6sta dema on \u00fea swi\u00f0ran healfe to his \u00f0am gecorenum & to his \u00f0am halgum, &\nHe swa cw\u00e6\u00f0: Cuma\u00f0 ge nu, gebledsode, & onfo\u00f0 mines f\u00e6der rice, \u00fe\u00e6t eow w\u00e6s geearuwad fram\n& \u00feonne gyt besyh\u00f0 ure dryhten on \u00fea wynstran hand to \u00f0am synfullan heape, & he \u00f0us cwe\u00f0 to him:\nHe swa cw\u00e6\u00f0: Gewita\u00f0 ge, awyrigde, fram me in \u00f0a neo\u00f0emestan helle wite & in \u00f0\u00e6t ece fyr, \u00f0e \u00f0am\n& \u00feonne gesamnia\u00f0 \u00f0a dioflu hie tosomne, & hie \u00f0onne drifa\u00f0 \u00fea synfullan & \u00fea cearfullan sawla to\n& se halga Petrus g\u00e6\u00f0 mid & bere\u00f0 hellec\u00e6gan on handa.\nEala, bro\u00f0or mine, hw\u00e6t, \u00f0\u00e6r m\u00e6g gehyran micel sorh & mycel wanung & mycel sworetung & mycel\n& \u00feonne drifa\u00f0 \u00f0a deofla \u00fea synfullan sawla & \u00fea dreorigan in helle witu, & hie sylfe ga\u00f0 mid in on\n& \u00feonne wende\u00f0 sanctus Petrus \u00feanon fram \u00fe\u00e6re helle dura, & he beluce\u00f0 \u00fea helle duru sy\u00f0\u00fean \u00fea\n& \u00feonne wende\u00f0 him sanctus Petrus \u00feanon fram \u00fe\u00e6re helle dura, & he \u00f0onne weorpe\u00f0 \u00f0a cearfullan\n\u00d0is he de\u00f0 for \u00f0am \u00fee he ne m\u00e6g locian on \u00f0\u00e6t mycle sar & on \u00f0am myclan wanunge & on \u00f0am\nEala, bro\u00f0or mine, hu mycel & hu hlud bi\u00f0 se cnyll \u00feonne seo c\u00e6ge fealle\u00f0 in \u00f0a helle.\nMen \u00f0a leofestan, si\u00f0\u00f0an ne \u00f0urfan \u00fea synfullan & \u00f0a sorhfullan sawla wenan, ne \u00f0a diofla \u00feon ma,\n& \u00feonne dryhten f\u00e6r\u00f0 him mid his englum & mid his apostolum & mid his \u00f0am haligra werode to\n& hie habba\u00f0 symle gefean sy\u00f0\u00f0an & blisse mid urum dryhtne, \u00f0am sie symble wuldor & wyr\u00f0mynd",
